{"id":"b57c381976b8272a","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-ccc-preservation.md","title":"CCC Preservation","display":"thm-ccc-preservation — CCC Preservation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ccc-preservation","aliases":["58-thm-ccc-preservation"],"display":"thm-ccc-preservation — CCC Preservation","depends_on":["[[58-df-ccc]]","[[58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-relation]]","[[58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ccc-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ccc-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ccc-preservation — CCC Preservation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"58-df-ccc\">58-df-ccc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"054f5df77a4bd18d\" href=\"?note=054f5df77a4bd18d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration\">58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q},\\mathbb R\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q},\\mathbb R\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"054f5df77a4bd18d\" href=\"?note=054f5df77a4bd18d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration\">58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\preccurlyeq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\preccurlyeq_P)\\)</span> is the order-sensitive ccc predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"58-df-ccc\">58-df-ccc</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}}\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}}\\)</span> is a fixed set-coded formula saying that its parameter is a ccc forcing notion</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> is the six-argument forcing relation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\n\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q}\\in M\\land\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle\\land\n\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\preccurlyeq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,1_P,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}},\\langle\\dot{\\mathbb Q}\\rangle,P,\\preccurlyeq_P)\n\\to\\mathrm{CCC}(R,\\preccurlyeq_R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\n\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q}\\in M\\land\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle\\land\n\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\preccurlyeq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,1_P,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}},\\langle\\dot{\\mathbb Q}\\rangle,P,\\preccurlyeq_P)\n\\to\\mathrm{CCC}(R,\\preccurlyeq_R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ground model, both order relations, top condition, ccc formula code, and the constructed two-step iteration are explicit.</li>\n<li>Two-step ccc preservation is the local form used in finite-support ccc iterations.</li>\n<li>A forcing extension has the form <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V[G]\">\\(V[G]\\)</span> for a generic filter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>; ccc alone does not define an object denoted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^{\\mathbb P}\">\\(V^{\\mathbb P}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ccc","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ccc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"054f5df77a4bd18d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S$ and $\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-zfc-transitive-model]] and [[58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"054f5df77a4bd18d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S$ and $\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-zfc-transitive-model]] and [[58-df-zfc-two-step-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ccc","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\preccurlyeq_P)$ is the order-sensitive ccc predicate from [[58-df-ccc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S$ is the six-argument forcing relation from [[58-df-zfc-forcing-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q},\\mathbb R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\preccurlyeq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\n\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q}\\in M\\land\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\preccurlyeq_P,1_P\\rangle\\land\n\\mathbb R=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,1_R\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{TwoStepIteration}_S(\\mathbb R,M,\\mathbb P,\\dot{\\mathbb Q})\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(P,\\preccurlyeq_P)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,1_P,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}},\\langle\\dot{\\mathbb Q}\\rangle,P,\\preccurlyeq_P)\n\\to\\mathrm{CCC}(R,\\preccurlyeq_R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V[G]","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"V^{\\mathbb P}","display":false}],"bytes":2072,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4073","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-ccc-preservation.md|58-thm-ccc-preservation]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["937fc0dd4cc72948","054f5df77a4bd18d","911508dbd8495663","a9132c2c1a18acd1"]}